      "proposed_content": "The source enlarges the original discriminant-indexed problem to the completed two-variable family Z_M, whose correction polynomials make its d- and n-sum presentations compatible and expose functional equations and polar lines; it then recovers the original family through the explicit sign/mod-8 decomposition and a conditional Möbius-weighted residue sieve.",
